Apple has a new version of the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/homepod/">HomePod</a> and a new <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/apple-tv/">Apple TV</a> 4K ready to go, but the devices may be tied to the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> update that's been continually postponed, according to <em><a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-03-09/apple-postpones-smart-home-display-launch-as-it-waits-for-new-ai-and-siri">Bloomberg's Mark Gurman</a></em>.<br/>
<br/>
